            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time a unit with the Deep Strike ability disembarks from this model after it has made a Normal move, that unit is still eligible to declare a charge this turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Sokar-pattern Stormbird" id="2227-a175-e719-f0b6" hidden="false" typeId="74f8-5443-9d6d-1f1e" typeName="Transport">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Capacity" typeId="30f2-be70-861d-1b84">This model has a transport capacity of 55 &lt;FACTION&gt; Infantry or &lt;FACTION&gt; MOUNTED models. Each JUMP PACK, WULFEN, GRAVIS, POSSESSED or TERMINATOR model takes up the space of 2 models and each MOUNTED, CENTURION or OBLITERATOR model takes up the space of 3 models. This model can also transport up to 1 RHINO model (this model – and any models embarked within it – take up the space of 25 models).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
