        <profile name="The Tyrant&apos;s Standard" id="9a9a-2ac8-c4f6-1f2e" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of weapons equipped by the bearer, and each time the bearer makes an attack, you can re-roll the Wound roll. In addition, each time the bearer&apos;s unit destroys an enemy unit, if your Crusade force is undertaking an Oathsworn Campaign, you gain 1 Honour point.</characteristic>
